解析7. (1)

$$
\begin{cases}
v_x' = \cfrac{v_x - u}{1 - \cfrac{u}{c^2}v_x} \\
v_y' = \cfrac{v_y \sqrt{1 - \frac{u^2}{c^2}}}{1 - \cfrac{u}{c^2}v_x} \\
v_z' = \cfrac{v_z \sqrt{1 - \frac{u^2}{c^2}}}{1 - \cfrac{u}{c^2}v_x}
\end{cases}
\tag{2}
$$

(2)

$$
\Delta = \frac{c\tau}{n_1 \sin\theta}
\tag{3}
$$

所以有

$$
\tau' = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - \frac{u^2}{c^2}}} \left( \tau - \frac{u\tau}{n_1 c \sin\theta} \right), \quad \Delta' = \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - \frac{u^2}{c^2}}} \left( \frac{c\tau}{n_1 \sin\theta} - u\tau \right)
\tag{4}
$$

(3)

$$
\sin i' = \frac{c\tau'}{n_2 \Delta'} = \frac{n_1 c \sin\theta - u}{n_2 c - n_1 n_2 u \sin\theta} \Longrightarrow i' = \arcsin \frac{n_1 c \sin\theta - u}{n_2 c - n_1 n_2 u \sin\theta}
\tag{5}
$$

再变回原系有:

$$
i = \arcsin \frac{n_1 \sin\theta}{\sqrt{1 - \frac{(1 - n_1 \sin\theta \frac{u}{c})^2 (1 - n_2^2)}{1 - \frac{u^2}{c^2}}}}
\tag{6}
$$

(4)

$$
\frac{n_1 c \sin\theta - u}{n_2 c - n_1 n_2 u \sin\theta} = 1 \Longrightarrow \theta_c = \arcsin \frac{n_2 c + u}{n_1 c + n_1 n_2 u}
\tag{7}
$$

(5) 取地面上高 $\Delta h$ 的薄层，地面和薄层上的相对流速 $u = \alpha \Delta h$，则由 (4) 知

$$
\sin\theta_c = \frac{n_0 c + u}{n_0 c + n_0^2 u} = \frac{R}{R + \Delta h}
\tag{8}
$$

解得

$$
R = \frac{n_0}{n_0^2 - 1} \frac{c}{\alpha}
\tag{9}
$$

评分标准: (1)共6分，(2)共6分，(3)共16分，(4)共6分，(5)共6分
